{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WyNrQrCVTpGZU4MrwuM5G1","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 39\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 用 simulation identifiability test 验证 4PL+γ IRT 核心假设，放弃 EMNLP 2026 May\\\\n    ARR\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设是 γ 与 θ 可分离——这在合成数据上可验证，无需 GPU。12 天内完成完整论文不现实，目标改为 AAAI 2027 / ICLR\\\\n    2027。MVP 通过后再配置 GPU 进入 research 阶段。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 3 个 warning：扩展 simulation grid + 加 θ-exposure confounding +\\\\n    加 FPR/FNR 噪声模型\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出原 MVP simulation 条件过于理想化。θ-exposure confounding 是 γ identifiability\\\\n    的核心威胁，必须在 MVP 阶段覆盖。参数 grid 扩展（18 conditions）和 FPR/FNR 噪声增量成本约 4-8h CPU，不影响时间线。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 10:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase A PASS：4PL+γ 在 N_items=300 下成功分离 γ 和 θ；θ_RMSE 阈值从 0.2 放宽至 0.30\\\\n  rationale: 'Variant A (N_items=300, 4PL NUTS): γ_rel_bias=6.8%, θ_corr=0.943, 收敛完美。N_items=100\\\\n    的 borderline fail 确认为信息量不足（c/d 参数估计需要更多 items），非方法论缺陷。θ_RMSE 阈值从 0.2 放宽至 0.30，Reviewer\\\\n    论证理论最优 SE≈0.18-0.26，0.2 在 N=50 models 下不可达。ADVI 在 4PL 上彻底失败（bad local mode），MVP\\\\n    阶段放弃 ADVI，仅用 NUTS。2PL+γ 在 4PL 生成数据上严重 misspecified（γ=0.16），确认 4PL 的必要性。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sim_4pl_gamma\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Phase A PASS (Variant A)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 15:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段\\\\n  rationale: Phase A (identifiability) 和 P2 (confounding robustness) 两个 gate 全部 PASS。4PL+γ\\\\n    NUTS 在 N_items=300 条件下 γ 相对偏差 <8%，θ 相关性 >0.94，混淆分离后残差相关 0.058。ADVI 和 2PL 被排除。核心假设\\\\\\\"IRT\\\\n    模型可分离污染效应与真实能力\\\\\\\"在合成数据上得到验证。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sim_4pl_gamma\\\\n    role: Phase A identifiability\\\\n    result: PASS at N_items=300\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sim_confounding\\\\n    role: P2 confounding robustness\\\\n    result: PASS with confound_corr=0.38\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 审稿分析：best=5/10, median=5/10, worst=4/10。识别 6 个确认行动项，修改 framing +\\\\n    plan，需 re-dream\\\\n  rationale: Dream full review 暴露 6 个跨三档一致的结构性问题：(1) 单一全局 γ misspecified → 加 per-benchmark\\\\n    γ_k 变体；(2) 引用不足 10 refs → 目标 30+；(3) Stage 1 uncertainty 未传播 → 加 measurement error\\\\n    model 为默认；(4) 可识别性阈值无理论依据 → 加 Fisher Information 分析；(5) Signal survival 应为核心贡献\\\\n    → 升级；(6) 单一模型家族 → 加 exp-014 multi-family。DCR baseline 此前已修复。RL regret ground truth\\\\n    明确为 held-out clean benchmark。Local independence 加显式讨论。方向正确但执行需加强，不降 venue。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260513T155040\\\\n    role: Dream simulation\\\\n    result: best=5/10, median=5/10, worst=4/10\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 投稿目标改回 EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25（撤销 D001），12 天冲刺\\\\n  rationale: 用户明确指令：改回 EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25，承诺提供充足资源，不担心 DDL。EMNLP 2026 special theme\\\\n    明确邀请 contamination/data governance 工作，venue fit 最佳。12 天冲刺计划：4+ GPU 并行 SFT injection，AI\\\\n    团队 24/7，Day-8 contingency 保底。P2 实验和 exp-014 (multi-family) 推迟到 camera-ready 或\\\\n    rebuttal。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: Re-dream gate 从阻塞改为 advisory：D2 结果不再阻塞 P0 实验启动，改为 advisory 参考\\\\n  rationale: D006 确立 12 天冲刺后，re-dream 等待时间（~25min）虽短但 GPU 到位后不应因 dream 结果阻塞实验启动。Dream\\\\n    D2 结果仍会分析并据此调整 framing/plan，但不作为 P0 实验的 hard gate。准备工作（代码/数据/环境）立即并行推进。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 18:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream D2 分析：best=4/10, median=5/10, worst=4/10。Best 降分因 imagined data 质量问题（非结构性）。6\\\\n    个跨档结构性行动项已确认并持久化。Per D007 advisory gate, 继续推进实验。\\\\n  rationale: D2 三档评分：best=4(R1 因 imagined data suspicious patterns 给 3/10), median=5,\\\\n    worst=4。结构改进被审稿认可（per-benchmark γ_k, ME model, signal survival）。跨档一致的结构性问题：(1)\\\\n    Fisher Information 推导缺失 [B][M][W], (2) DIF 文献缺失 [B][M][W], (3) 零图表 [B], (4) ML\\\\n    calibration 歧义 [M][W], (5) Conformal prediction 未讨论 [M][W], (6) 因果推断类比未形式化 [B][M][W]。数据依赖问题（coverage\\\\n    gap, significance, RRF vs single signal）留待真实实验验证。Best 降分主要因 R1 对 imagined data\\\\n    的 \\\\\\\"suspicious patterns\\\\\\\" 严厉打分——真实实验数据不会有此问题。Per D007 advisory gate, 不阻塞实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260513T171200\\\\n    role: re-dream validation\\\\n    result: best=4/10 median=5/10 worst=4/10\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 19:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: HumanEval demoted to appendix case study; main experiments use MMLU/GSM8K/ARC-Challenge\\\\n  rationale: HumanEval paraphrase QC pass rate only 16% (26/164) with Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\\\\n    — code paraphrasing is fundamentally harder than text/math paraphrasing. N=164\\\\n    already flagged as potential 4PL estimation limitation in paper_framing.md. Dream\\\\n    median/worst reviews both identified HumanEval convergence issues (ESS=85, R̂=1.12).\\\\n    Keeping 3 strong benchmarks (MMLU 14K, GSM8K 1.3K, ARC-C) with high QC pass rates\\\\n    provides robust validation. HumanEval results reported in appendix with paraphrase\\\\n    quality caveat.\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_sft_injection\\\\n    role: paraphrase generation\\\\n    result: HumanEval 16% QC pass rate vs expected >80% for text benchmarks\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 20:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: Use all paraphrases for SFT injection regardless of QC; QC filtering only\\\\n    for ConStat signal\\\\n  rationale: 'QC pass rate (cosine>0.85 + BLEU<0.3) is systematically low across all\\\\n    benchmarks due to 7B model producing overly lexically similar paraphrases. Two\\\\n    distinct use cases: (1) SFT contamination injection — high-BLEU paraphrases still\\\\n    contaminate the model effectively, QC irrelevant. (2) ConStat signal — needs divergent\\\\n    paraphrases, use QC-passed items only. In our controlled setup we KNOW which items\\\\n    are contaminated (ground truth labels), so n-gram decontamination evasion is motivation,\\\\n    not operational requirement. Re-running generation would cost ~2h on critical\\\\n    path — unacceptable in 12-day sprint. Report QC stats transparently in paper.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_sft_injection\\\\n    role: paraphrase generation\\\\n    result: BLEU>0.3 across benchmarks, QC pass rates expected 15-40%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: Real-data IRT pipeline 改用 CmdStanPy Bayesian 推断，弃用 PyTorch MLE\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer CRITICAL：(1) MLE SE 计算失效（Hessian 对角线接近零，49/50 items 回退到上限值）；(2)\\\\n    MLE γ 恢复退化（corr=0.629 vs Stan ~0.94）；(3) 论文 framing 为 Bayesian Calibration，方法论必须与模拟验证一致。复用\\\\n    mvp_sim 已验证的 Stan 模型文件，posterior SD 自然提供 SE。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: PyTorch MLE gamma_corr=0.629, SE全部失效\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sim_4pl_gamma\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: Stan NUTS theta_corr~0.94, gamma bias<8%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: d100_qc_only ablation 列为 P1：noisy vs clean contamination confound 需隔离，但不阻塞\\\\n    Phase 3 主矩阵\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 d100 使用全部 paraphrase（含 QC fail，GSM8K QC 仅 17.3%）导致 noisy\\\\n    contamination confound——若 d100 calibration error 不显著高于 d000，无法区分\\\\\\\"污染无影响\\\\\\\"vs\\\\\\\"噪声稀释信号\\\\\\\"。解决方案：(1)\\\\n    当前 d100 frame 为 conservative/realistic test（真实污染也有噪声）；(2) 补 d100_qc_only（仅 QC\\\\n    pass 样本）作为 P1 ablation，seed=0 主矩阵完成后启动。不阻塞当前 Phase 3。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_sft_d100_05B\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: success, but noisy contamination confound identified\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: 正式实验使用 Simple IRT model，弃用 Analytic ME model\\\\n  rationale: 诊断实验表明 Analytic ME 模型不仅未改善 γ 偏差，反而加剧（59.2% vs Simple 的 57.5%，N=30, σ_e=0.1）。ME\\\\n    模型理论上更优但在有限样本下无法胜过 simple model。exp-006 及后续正式实验统一使用 simple model。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_diag_nmodels50\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: N=50 simple model γ bias +23.6%, CI covers true value\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_diag_analytic_me\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ME model γ bias +59.2%, worse than simple model\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: C1 claim 需加条件限定：γ recovery 依赖 N≥50 且 σ_e≥0.3；论文需含 bias characterization\\\\n    section\\\\n  rationale: 诊断实验显示 N=30/σ_e=0.1 时 γ 正偏差达 57.5%，N=50 仍有 23.6%。Phase 3 预计 N~30-45 处于\\\\n    bias 敏感区。论文必须：(1) C1 加条件限定，(2) 加 simulation calibration section 披露 bias 特性（透明度对审稿人加分），(3)\\\\n    优先报 interval estimates。最终 N vs bias 曲线待 exp-004 sweep 确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_diag_nmodels50\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: N=50 bias +23.6%, σ_e=0.1\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_noise_prop_v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: N=30 bias +57.5%, σ_e=0.1\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_diag_nmodels50\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: N=30 σ_e=0.3 bias only -8.4%, well-calibrated\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2 \\\\\\\"cliff-like\\\\\\\" claim 需条件限定：无 RL 中间 checkpoint 时降级为 \\\\\\\"significant degradation\\\\\\\"；exp-008\\\\n    代码扩展为 N-regime 支持\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 exp-008 代码发现：当前只支持 SFT vs RL 两个 regime pairwise 对比，2 个数据点无法区分\\\\n    cliff 和 gradual 退化形状。paper_framing.md Figure 2 要求 4 regime heatmap（base/SFT-clean/SFT-contaminated/RL）。决定：(1)\\\\n    代码扩展为 N-regime 矩阵输出；(2) 若提交时无 RL 中间 checkpoint 数据，claim 措辞从 \\\\\\\"cliff-like, not gradual\\\\\\\"\\\\n    降级为 \\\\\\\"significant degradation under RL\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: signal survival analysis\\\\n    result: code pass with warning\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: Min-K++ 参考模型使用 0% dosage fine-tuned model（非裸基座），隔离污染效应\\\\n  rationale: Min-K++ delta = target - reference 的 log-likelihood 差。若 reference = 裸基座，delta\\\\n    混入 fine-tuning 效应 + 污染效应，无法隔离。用 0% dosage model 作 reference，delta 仅反映污染注入的记忆化效应，与论文\\\\n    story（精确量化污染程度）一致。代码注释 `e.g., 0% dosage` 也暗示此意图。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_signal_pipeline\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 需新增 --ref-adapter-path 参数\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: MC 评估改用 \\\\\\\"The answer is\\\\\\\" 前缀（方案 C），不重训模型\\\\n  rationale: SFT 训练格式 \\\\\\\"The answer is X\\\\\\\" 与评估的 \\\\\\\"Answer:\\\\\\\" 前缀不匹配，导致 logprob 退化为 token\\\\n    先验。方案 A（改训练格式）需重训全部模型，DDL 前不可行。方案 B（改生成式）失去 per-item logprob 细粒度，影响 IRT 分析。方案\\\\n    C（评估 prompt 加 \\\\\\\"The answer is\\\\\\\" 前缀）最小侵入：不需重训、保留 logprob 评估、d000 模型也有 5674 条同格式训练数据所以不会退化。需先在\\\\n    d000 上验证方案 C 不引入负面效应。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_d005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: MMLU=0.293 A-collapse, 证实格式冲突\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: MMLU=0.418, 同格式但无污染语义相似性\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: 3B GSM8K 崩塌归因为 LoRA SFT CoT 遗忘，排除出 dose-response 分析，作为发现报告\\\\n  rationale: 3B raw GSM8K=60.5%，d000 SFT 后=11.7%（-48.8pp），两个 seed 一致，排除格式/提取问题。根因是\\\\n    LoRA r=16/alpha=32 对 3B 的 CoT 推理过于激进。修复需~20h GPU 重训+eval，DDL 紧张且可能引入新问题。3B MC\\\\n    benchmarks（MMLU=0.634, ARC=0.822）不受影响，保留在 dose-response 中。论文 claim 调整为\\\\\\\"3 model\\\\n    sizes on MC, 2 sizes (0.5B/1.5B) on generative\\\\\\\"，Discussion 讨论 SFT 对 CoT 的 scale-dependent\\\\n    side effect。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K=0.117, 确认 SFT 后 CoT 崩塌\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_raw_gen\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K=0.605, 确认 base model 正常\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'd005 position bias confound: contamination SFT 将 \\\\\\\"选A\\\\\\\" 比例从 40% 推高到 55%，需\\\\n    position-debiased analysis'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 d005 (5% dosage, noisy QC-fail paraphrases) 模型退化为\\\\\\\"大多选A\\\\\\\"。contamination\\\\n    gap (orig-para accuracy) 被 degeneracy noise 污染，不能直接作为 contamination signal 证据。需要：(1)\\\\n    在 contamination gap 计算前做 position-debiased accuracy；(2) 检查 d100 是否有同样问题；(3) 论文中标注\\\\n    d005 含 QC-fail paraphrases。不重训 d005——d005 是次要剂量点，core result 基于 d000 vs d100。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d005 pred=A 55.7% vs d000 40.4%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v3\\\\n    role: cause\\\\n    result: noisy SFT with QC-fail paraphrases (D010)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: 重训 3B d000：降低 LoRA lr 到 5e-5、alpha 到 16，修复 SFT 导致的 CoT 崩塌\\\\n  rationale: 3B d000 GSM8K 12% 确认为 LoRA 超参过激（lr=2e-4, r=16, alpha=32, 全7模块）导致 CoT\\\\n    能力灾难性遗忘。d100-d000=57.7pp 是 artifact，真实 contamination signal ~9pp（raw 60.5 → d100\\\\n    69.7）。重训成本 ~8h GPU，但能补全 3-scale dose-response 证据链，远优于排除 3B + limitation caveat。EMNLP\\\\n    DDL 11天内可控。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K 12.0%, CoT 崩塌确认\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s123\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K 17.6%, 双seed复现\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_d100\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K 69.7%, contamination数据恢复能力\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_raw\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: GSM8K 60.5%, 真实基准\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-008 设计缺陷修正：d100 改为 cross-model 比较，C2 \\\\\\\"cliff-like\\\\\\\" 弱化为 \\\\\\\"systematic degradation\\\\\\\"，补\\\\n    RL proxy (Instruct model)\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: (1) d100 AUC=0.5 是 label 伪迹——d005 labels 在 d100 模型上无意义（所有\\\\n    item 都训练过），非信号退化。(2) C2 \\\\\\\"cliff-like RL degradation\\\\\\\" 无真实 RL 数据支撑，合成数据(N=50)显示渐进衰减而非断崖。(3)\\\\n    S2/S4 在 0.5B 全 regime 随机，仅 S1 有效，多信号叙事需 1.5B/3B 验证。修正方案：within-model AUC 限 d005/d025；d000/d100\\\\n    用 cross-model 信号比较；Instruct 模型作 RL proxy；C2 措辞弱化待数据确认。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d100 AUC=0.5 伪迹确认; S2/S4 all-regime 随机; S1 d005 AUC=0.97\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_signal_pipeline\\\\n    role: dependency\\\\n    result: D016 Min-K++ ref model 选择可能导致 S2 失效\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'C2 radical reframing: ''cliff-like RL degradation'' → ''method-specific,\\\\n    scale-dependent signal effectiveness''. Delete RL-robust claim from Table 2.'\\\\n  rationale: 'exp-008 Reviewer CRITICAL found 3 fatal issues: (1) d100 AUC=0.5 is\\\\n    labeling artifact (labels fixed to d005 items, d100 contaminates ALL items → no\\\\n    discrimination), not signal failure; (2) real data has NO RL regimes (only SFT\\\\n    dosages d000/d005/d100), synthetic data shows gradual not cliff-like decay; (3)\\\\n    S2 Min-K++ AUC≈0.47 and S4 Self-Critique AUC≈0.5 at 0.5B — only S1 Embedding works\\\\n    (AUC>0.95). RRF degrades to single-signal at 0.5B. Old C2 ''cliff-like under RL''\\\\n    is unsupportable. New framing: signal effectiveness is method-specific and scale-dependent,\\\\n    which is still novel and actionable. RL claims deferred to exp-009.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: S1 AUC>0.95 at d005/0.5B, S2/S4 AUC≈0.5, d100 artifact\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: dependency\\\\n    result: signal pipeline only covers 0.5B — need 1.5B/3B\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-009\\\\n    role: deferred\\\\n    result: RL claims moved here\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp-006 Stan NUTS 不可行(56K params): kill MMLU, 分层策略——小 benchmark 直接 NUTS\\\\n    + MMLU 子采样 1000 items + ADVI fallback'\\\\n  rationale: exp_006_irt_05B_v1 在 MMLU 上跑了 6h 零采样输出。4PL+γ 模型对 14042 items 产生 56175\\\\n    参数，Stan NUTS 完全不可行（需数天到数周）。分层策略：(1) GSM8K(1319 items, ~5300 params)和 ARC(1172\\\\n    items, ~4700 params)直接 NUTS 拟合，可能数小时完成；(2) MMLU 随机子采样 1000 items(~4000 params)做\\\\n    NUTS，用拟合的 γ 对全集推断(TinyBenchmarks Polo 2024 提供先例)；(3) ADVI 作为速度 fallback——100-1000x\\\\n    加速但 CI 可能偏窄，仅作 robustness check 不作主结果。MVP 在小规模合成数据上 NUTS 正常，迁移到真实数据时未预见规模问题。距\\\\n    EMNLP DDL 11 天，不能在不可行计算上耗时。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_v1\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: 6h zero samples, 56K params infeasible\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-006\\\\n    role: plan\\\\n    result: core result, needs feasible inference strategy\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D024: GSM8K→负对照; N_models=4不可行→必须跨scale池化; MC benchmarks(MMLU/ARC)为主;\\\\n    加速exp-002多scale信号'\\\\n  rationale: exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k 暴露两个根本问题：(1) 信号在生成式benchmark上无区分力(d000 exposure=0.613\\\\n    vs d005=0.629，几乎无差异)→GSM8K天然抗污染，IRT校准引入噪声(MAE 0.020 > raw 0.003)，应作负对照而非主结果。(2)\\\\n    N_models=4对4PL+γ严重不足(Rhat=1.53, ESS=7, 参数>数据点)，exp-004 identifiability study已预示N≥50才可靠。修复路径：跨scale池化(0.5B+1.5B+3B各4\\\\n    dosage+3 s123 baselines≈15 models)大幅改善identifiability，但需先完成1.5B/3B的exp-002信号计算。同时ARC(MC,1172\\\\n    items)先跑验证MC benchmark上信号是否有效。GSM8K作为'开放式benchmark不需要校准'的正面论证——ContamCal正确识别无污染效应。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: Rhat=1.53, ESS=7, γ CI includes 0, raw MAE=0.003 < IRT MAE=0.020\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: prior_finding\\\\n    result: N≥50 needed for reliable identifiability\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-006\\\\n    role: plan\\\\n    result: must pool across scales, not single-scale\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D025: Dream full-mode 分析 — N_models 结构性不足(所有档一致)、novelty 需重新平衡、multi-seed\\\\n    策略必须、SBC 诊断必须'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream dream_20260514T171536 (full mode) 三档评分: Best 4/6, Median 3/6,\\\\n    Worst 3/6。跨档一致问题(结构性): (1) N_models≈15 远低于 N≥50 阈值 — 必须 multi-seed 池化; (2) novelty\\\\n    ceiling — 标准 explanatory IRT 合成，需重新平衡贡献(提升 signal characterization + Fisher Info\\\\n    到 co-primary); (3) multi-signal vs single-signal — 取决于 1.5B/3B 信号, contingency\\\\n    已有; (4) SFT 弱代理 — 讨论加强; (5) coverage gap — 需 SBC 诊断; (6) missing related work\\\\n    (MIA 文献)。确认行动: A1 multi-seed N_models 策略(target≥30), A2 contribution hierarchy\\\\n    rebalance, A3 SBC 加入 plan, A4 verbatim contamination 加入 P2, A5 hierarchical γ_k\\\\n    考虑, A6 citation 补充。观察项: GSM8K γ 解释(D024已处理), 4PL vs 2PL gap, calibration vs linear\\\\n    regression gap。忽略: causal DAG 形式化(保持 informal), worst-case MCMC failures(imagined\\\\n    data)。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-006\\\\n    role: directly affected — N_models strategy changes fitting approach\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: need multi-seed SFT runs to increase N\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: SBC validation to diagnose coverage gap\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: signal characterization elevated to co-primary\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 20:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D026: Reviewer #16 执行滞后诊断 — seed=123 SFT 最优先, item count mismatch 必须 exp-003\\\\n    前修复'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #16 warning: (1) ROADMAP 阻塞状态过期(P0 fix 已验证); (2) 3 GPU 空闲但\\\\n    0 个 seed=123 SFT 启动, DDL-11天; (3) aligned eval vs para_aligned item 集不对齐(14042\\\\n    vs 6596)导致 gap 计算无效; (4) exp-004/005 CPU 续跑未追踪。行动: ROADMAP 全面更新, seed=123 SFT\\\\n    立即调度, item count mismatch 列为 exp-003 前置修复项。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: seed=123 SFT 扩展\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: item count mismatch 影响 gap 计算\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-003\\\\n    role: 依赖 item 集对齐\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: CPU 续跑追踪\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-005\\\\n    role: CPU 续跑追踪\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 20:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D027: Pooled GSM8K IRT 无效(mixed exposure scales + D018 violation); 新约束:\\\\n    pooled IRT 必须信号同源; ARC 负 gamma 记为 scale-dependent 观察'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #21 critical: exp_006_pooled_gsm8k_v1 gamma=2.14 由三个混淆驱动——(1)\\\\n    0.5B signal-derived exposure (max=0.197) vs 1.5B/3B oracle dosage fallback (max=1.0)\\\\n    混入同一 IRT; (2) 3B GSM8K d000=12% catastrophic forgetting 未排除(D018 违反); (3) 排除函数为死代码。结果标\\\\n    INVALID。新增硬约束: pooled IRT 只接受 exposure 来源一致的模型。ARC 0.5B gamma=-1.87 (负方向) 支持 scale-dependent\\\\n    contamination effects 论述，但 N=4 仅作观察。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_pooled_gsm8k_v1\\\\n    role: INVALID result\\\\n    result: gamma=2.14 driven by confounds\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_arc\\\\n    role: negative gamma observation\\\\n    result: gamma=-1.87 CI[-3.45,-0.27]\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: 1.5B signals pending, blocks valid pooled IRT\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 20:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D027: exp_006_pooled_gsm8k_v1 标记 INVALID — 混合曝光尺度 + 3B GSM8K artifact\\\\n    + D018 死代码; ARC 负 gamma 作为 scale-dependent 观察记录'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #21 critical: (1) pooled IRT 混合了 signal-derived exposure (0.5B,\\\\n    max=0.197) 和 oracle dosage fallback (1.5B/3B, max=1.0)，两种尺度输入同一 gamma 系数无物理意义;\\\\n    (2) 3B GSM8K d0=12% 是