n  - exp_id: exp_002_constat\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: S3 从未被计算，全 null；raw gap 代码有 bug 但无影响\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_15B_aligned_batch\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d000 baseline gap 证明 paraphrase difficulty confound\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d000 baseline gap 证明 paraphrase difficulty confound\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_006 pooled IRT v2 exposure 仅用 s1_embedding，违反 D030 的 3-signal RRF 决策，需紧急修复并重跑\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 发现：load_exp002_signals() 默认 signal_key=\\\\\\\"s1_embedding\\\\\\\"，导致\\\\n    0.5B 和 1.5B 在每个 dosage 获得完全相同的 exposure 值。s2_minkpp 和 s4_selfcritique 是 model-specific\\\\n    的但被忽略。这是 claim-code 不匹配——论文若声称用 3-signal RRF，数据却只基于 s1。修复代码改动量 <10 行，重跑 ~300s/benchmark。Agent\\\\n    已在处理修复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: exposure计算缺陷，需重跑\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Pooled IRT N=8 首次结果: ARC γ=-1.46 显著负(CI排除0), GSM8K/MMLU不显著(N不足). ARC确认scale-dependent\\\\n    contamination退化效应, seed=123完成后N→16预期GSM8K收窄'\\\\n  rationale: '0.5B+1.5B跨scale池化(N=8 models)首次产出Paper Table 1数据. ARC CI [-2.51,-0.41]排除0,\\\\n    确认contamination在小模型导致退化而非提升, 与单0.5B γ=-1.87一致且CI收窄(功效提升). GSM8K γ=0.12正方向但CI含0,\\\\n    MMLU γ=-0.21接近0, 均因N=8功效不足. Critical path: seed=123 SFT+eval+signals→N=16 refit,\\\\n    预期CI收窄√2倍. MAE~3.5pp(GSM8K/ARC)与linear baseline接近, 表明IRT校准精度合理.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: ARC γ=-1.46 significant, GSM8K/MMLU n.s.\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: upstream\\\\n    result: SFT injection models\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: upstream\\\\n    result: 3-signal RRF exposure scores\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n  - D028\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D032 结果需纠偏: Agent 审计发现 pooled IRT 6 个严重问题——coverage 系统性崩塌(25%-62.5% vs\\\\n    95%), GSM8K 跨版本 γ 矛盾, MMLU 未收敛, 缺 oracle baseline. ARC 方向仍成立但 CI 过窄. 启动三线并行修复'\\\\n  rationale: 'Agent 自审发现之前汇报的 γ 取自 joint_fit.global_gamma(层级参数)而非 per-benchmark γ.\\\\n    实际 ARC per-benchmark γ=-2.35 方向更强但 coverage_95=62.5%说明 CI 系统性过窄. GSM8K v2 γ=0.19\\\\n    vs v3 γ=2.10 矛盾(同数据同exposure), v3 PPP=0.0 模型拟合失败. MMLU rhat=1.54/ESS=7 完全不可用.\\\\n    根因: (1) N=8 模型导致 posterior 精度过估 (2) 无 oracle baseline 无法验证 signal-derived exposure\\\\n    有效性 (3) 代码变更导致 GSM8K 跨版本不一致. 修复路径: wider priors + seed=123→N=16 + oracle baseline\\\\n    对照.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: coverage collapse, GSM8K contradictory, MMLU unconverged\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: sim sweep should inform prior sensitivity\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D032\\\\n  - D027\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: Exposure source 切回 S1-only，废弃 RRF fusion 作为 per-model exposure\\\\n  rationale: RRF 单调性审计确认 4/4 (bench×scale) 组合 RRF_norm 不单调——S2/S4 噪声破坏 S1 的完美单调性 (0.5946→0.8998)。RRF\\\\n    导致 ARC gamma 从 -2.35 恶化到 -7.62，GSM8K gamma 从 0.19 跳到 2.10（ppp=0.0）。S1 embedding\\\\n    单独单调且 v2 结果可作 baseline。Per-item tau 是更好的长期方向但超出当前 scope。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: S1-only gamma=-2.35, monotonic exposure\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v3-rrf\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: RRF gamma=-7.62, non-monotonic exposure, MAE 0.172\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-gsm8k-v4-rrf\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: RRF gamma=2.10, ppp=0.0\\\\n  - exp_id: D031\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: confirmed v2=S1-only, v3+=RRF fusion\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Oracle baseline 确认 benchmark-dependent contamination effect: ARC 退化 (γ=-2.83)\\\\n    vs GSM8K 膨胀 (γ=+3.77)'\\\\n  rationale: Oracle exposure (dosage/100 as τ, N=15) 结果：ARC gamma=-2.83 显著负（CI排除零），GSM8K\\\\n    gamma=+3.77 显著正。两个方向均被 IRT 正确捕捉。Oracle fit quality 明显优于 signal-derived（ARC MAE\\\\n    0.047 vs 0.115）。论文 framing 需从\\\\\\\"单一膨胀\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"benchmark-dependent effect\\\\\\\"。PPP/coverage\\\\n    仍有系统偏差，需更多 N 或模型改进。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-arc\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: gamma=-2.83, CI[-3.72,-1.89], MAE=0.047\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-gsm8k\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: gamma=+3.77, CI[2.64,4.96], MAE=0.089, rhat=1.012\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v3-rrf\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: gamma=-7.62, MAE=0.115\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-gsm8k-v4-rrf\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: gamma=2.10, ppp=0.0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D034\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 00:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: ARC negative gamma + coverage collapse + 跨种子方差：三大发现要求 framing 适配\\\\n  rationale: 1) ARC γ 在 s42/s123 raw scores 和 oracle IRT 三条独立证据链下均为负。contamination\\\\n    对 ARC 造成 forgetting 而非 inflation，与 MMLU 方向相反。framing 从\\\\\\\"score inflation\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"benchmark-dependent\\\\n    contamination effects\\\\\\\"——calibration 在两个方向都有效，这是更强的 story。2) Coverage 在 oracle\\\\n    下仍仅 ARC 20%/GSM8K 33%（95% 名义），PPP 在极值（ARC 1.0/GSM8K 0.0）。4PL+gamma additive 模型可能不够充分，需调查：(a)\\\\n    N_models 增大后是否改善 (b) exp-004 sweep 预期 coverage (c) 是否需要更灵活的 IRT 结构。3) 0.5B d100\\\\n    跨种子方差 ARC 7.25pp/MMLU 7.24pp，multi-seed pooling 是必要条件。4) oracle vs RRF 被 N_models\\\\n    差异混淆(15 vs 8)，需匹配 N 重跑。5) GSM8K oracle rhat/ESS 不通过，需更长 chains。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-arc\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: gamma=-2.83, coverage=20%, PPP=1.0\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-gsm8k\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: gamma=+3.77, coverage=33%, PPP=0.0, diagnostics FAIL\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_d100_s123_aligned\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ARC=36.7% vs s42=29.4%, delta=7.25pp\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v3-rrf\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: N=8 RRF pooled\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D035\\\\n  - D032\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 03:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: Oracle GSM8K γ=+3.77 显著但校准反而更差——论文需要从\\\\\\\"calibration method\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"detection vs\\\\n    calibration gap\\\\\\\"分析框架\\\\n  rationale: 三个关键证据：(1) Oracle GSM8K γ=+3.77 [2.74,4.71] 显著正向，ARC γ=-1.46 [-2.51,-0.41]\\\\n    显著负向——benchmark-dependent direction confirmed；(2) 即使 oracle 场景，IRT calibrated\\\\n    score MAE=0.092 远劣于 raw score MAE=0.005，coverage 仅 31%，PPP=0 系统性 misfit；(3) S1-only\\\\n    GSM8K γ=+0.12 非显著——signal choice 也影响检测力。核心矛盾：IRT 能检测 contamination signal，但 calibrated\\\\n    scores 反而更差。论文不应声称\\\\\\\"提出校准方法\\\\\\\"，而应系统分析\\\\\\\"检测 ≠ 校准\\\\\\\"的 gap，这是更诚实、更有新意的贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-gsm8k-extended-v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: γ=+3.77 significant, but MAE/coverage/PPP all poor\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-s1only-gsm8k-v2\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: γ=+0.12 non-significant with S1 signal\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-arc\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: γ=-1.46 significant negative, opposite direction\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 05:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Paper framing pivot: 从 \\\\\\\"calibration method\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"detection + benchmark-dependent\\\\n    characterization\\\\\\\" 分析论文'\\\\n  rationale: 所有已完成 IRT 实验均显示 IRT 校准不优于 raw baseline（GSM8K oracle 4PL MAE 18x worse,\\\\n    ARC 2PL MAE worse, GSM8K S1 2PL MAE 4x worse）。Coverage 在 γ 显著时系统性崩塌（18-33%）。Claim\\\\n    1 \\\\\\\"MAE improvement + nominal coverage\\\\\\\" 与数据直接矛盾。Claim 2/3 实验覆盖率为 0%。但 detection\\\\n    方面有强证据：(1) γ 在 oracle 条件下双 benchmark 显著；(2) 方向 benchmark-dependent（GSM8K+, ARC-）；(3)\\\\n    模型复杂度需匹配任务结构（4PL for MCQ, 2PL for open-ended）；(4) S1 signal 只对 memorization-based\\\\n    tasks 有效。这些构成\\\\\\\"系统性分析 contamination 在 IRT 框架下的行为\\\\\\\"的论文贡献，比\\\\\\\"提出校准方法\\\\\\\"更诚实且更有新意。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-gsm8k-extended-v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: γ=+3.77 significant but MAE=0.092 >> raw 0.005\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-arc-2pl\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: γ=-0.618 significant but MAE=0.076 > raw 0.069, coverage 18%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-s1only-gsm8k-v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: γ=0.17 ns, IRT MAE 4x worse than raw\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-arc\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 4PL γ=-1.46 significant, best MAE on ARC but coverage collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D037\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 29209, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013Ct5PjcQGkavBaXRDvPfXt","session_id":"2e2bc174-5249-4ea4-a7dc-2e60f9f53d62","uuid":"cf99923f-ec12-4272-9558-9a32542ea302","timestamp":"2026-05-15T06:30:06.432Z"}
